d:
    a schema:Dataset ;
    schema:citation "https://biodiversity.org.au/nsl/services/export/index"^^xsd:anyURI ;
    schema:codeRepository "https://github.com/dcceew-bdr/bdr-resources-data/tree/main/source/datasets/ref/apni-common-names"^^xsd:anyURI ;
    schema:creator <https://linked.data.gov.au/org/dcceew> ;
    schema:dateCreated "2026-10-30"^^xsd:date ;
    schema:dateModified "2026-11-02"^^xsd:date ;
    schema:description """Common-name mappings from the APNI common-name export downloaded on 30 October 2026, containing 64,714 source records and 37,165 distinct common-name and scientific-name identifier pairs.

Names retain their APNI identifiers. Mappings are represented through NSL TaxonNameUsage resources, with the common-name usage linked to a scientific-name usage using nsl:citing. Source citation text, licence and attribution are retained.

This is a draft conversion. The nsl:citing translation requires maintainer confirmation. Scientific-name usage identifiers are unresolved for 64,713 source records and are represented by anonymous nodes; these nodes do not assert distinct real-world usages. Publication identifiers and page numbers are included only where verified from APNI source evidence.""" ;
    schema:identifier "APNI" ;
    schema:isBasedOn <https://biodiversity.org.au/nsl/services/export/index> ;
    schema:license ccby3: ;
    schema:name "APNI Common Names" ;
    schema:publisher <https://linked.data.gov.au/org/dcceew> ;
    schema:version "1" ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom csv: ;
.
